('a1-u08-l05-q01','a1-u08-l05','multiple_choice','It is raining. What do you need?','[{"id":"a","text":"an umbrella"},{"id":"b","text":"sunglasses only"},{"id":"c","text":"a swimsuit"}]','a','An umbrella helps keep you dry in the rain.',1),
('a1-u08-l05-q02','a1-u08-l05','multiple_choice','It is very cold. What is a good choice?','[{"id":"a","text":"a warm coat"},{"id":"b","text":"a thin T-shirt"},{"id":"c","text":"sandals"}]','a','A warm coat is suitable for cold weather.',2),
('a1-u08-l05-q03','a1-u08-l05','multiple_choice','Complete: It is sunny. Let''s ___ to the park.','[{"id":"a","text":"go"},{"id":"b","text":"goes"},{"id":"c","text":"going"}]','a','After let''s, use the base form of the verb.',3),
('a1-u08-l05-q04','a1-u08-l05','multiple_choice','It is hot today. Which activity is suitable?','[{"id":"a","text":"swimming"},{"id":"b","text":"making a snowman"},{"id":"c","text":"wearing a thick coat"}]','a','Swimming is a common activity in hot weather.',4);
